WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.860
They did not save your life.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:25.640
They stole it.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.420
This is Major.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:40.900
I'm on site.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:50.100
I'm going in.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.020
You are the first of your kind.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.540
But you're not invulnerable.

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.100
Maybe next time you can design me better.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:21.060
Everyone around me...they feel...connected to something.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.500
Connected to something I'm...not.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:30.740
What are you?

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.260
You were dying.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:40.340
We saved you.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.720
And now you save others.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.660
I don't know who to trust.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:01.720
You trust me right?

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:06.540
I know I have a past.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.560
I'll find out who I was.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:22.160
Everything they told you was a lie.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:23.640
Who are you?

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.220
They did not save your life.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.100
They stole it.

